1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
번아웃은 너무 많이 줘서 오는 줄 알았어요.
They say burnout comes from giving too much.

2
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:06,160
파커 파머는 말했어요.
Parker Palmer wrote,

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:12,280
번아웃은 내게 없는 걸 주려 할 때 온다고.
"Burnout in my experience results from trying to give what I do not possess."

4
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:17,635
작은 일에 무너지고 설렘도 사라진 날.
Small things make you crumble, and even excitement fades.

5
00:00:17,735 --> 00:00:23,500
그건 약함이 아니라 채우라는 알림일지도요.
Maybe that's not weakness. It's an alert to fill up first.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:30,000
오늘은 따르지 말고 채워요.
Today, don't pour. Fill.
